Goal 1 (goal): x = y.
Proof:
  x
= { by lemma 11 R->L }
  f(f(f(f(X, y), y), f(Y, y)), x)
= { by lemma 11 R->L }
  f(x, f(f(f(f(X, y), y), f(Y, y)), x))
